# The `disk` image driver's store. Real bytes uploaded by a real merchant during
# development — never committed, and NOT a fixture: src/images/disk.ts refuses to
# write at all when NODE_ENV=production, so anything in here is local by
# definition.
#
# In api/ rather than the root .gitignore because the root file is trunk-owned and
# `api/` is this lane's column (CLAUDE.md § Lanes). The default IMAGE_STORE_PATH
# resolves against api/, so this is also where the directory actually lands.
.image-store/

# The bundled serverless handler, produced by `scripts/build-function.mjs` during
# Vercel's build command. Generated, never edited, never committed — the source is
# `src/serverless.ts` and the reasoning is in the script's header. `_serverless.d.ts`
# beside it IS committed: it is the hand-written type, not the output.
api/_serverless.js
